"如何编写高质量的声音描述" = "How to Write High-Quality Voice Descriptions";
"核心原则" = "Core Principles";
"具体而非模糊" = "Be Specific, Not Vague";
"使用描绘声音特质的词语，如 “低沉” “清脆” “语速偏快”，避免 “好听” “普通” 等模糊的表述。" = "Use words that describe vocal characteristics, such as 'deep' 'crisp' and 'fast-paced' Avoid vague descriptions like 'pleasant' or 'ordinary' ";
"多维而非单一" = "Cover Multiple Dimensions";
"好的描述通常涵盖多个维度，如性别、年龄、情感等。仅写 “女声” 过于宽泛，难以生成有特色的音色。" = "Good descriptions typically cover multiple dimensions, such as gender, age, and emotion. Simply writing 'female voice' is too broad to produce a distinctive voice.";
"客观而非主观" = "Be Objective, Not Subjective";
"聚焦声音的物理和感知特征。例如，用 “音调偏高，富有活力” 代替 “我最喜欢的声音”。" = "Focus on the physical and perceptual characteristics of the voice. For example, use 'high-pitched and energetic' instead of 'my favorite voice' ";
"原创而非模仿" = "Describe, Don’t Imitate";
"描述声音的特质，而非要求模仿特定人物，如名人或演员。模型不支持模仿特定人物，且此类要求可能涉及版权风险。" = "Describe vocal characteristics rather than asking the model to imitate specific people, such as celebrities or actors. The model does not support imitating specific individuals, and such requests may involve copyright risks.";
"简洁而非冗余" = "Be Concise, Not Redundant";
"确保每个词都有明确作用，避免重复的同义词或无意义的修饰。" = "Make sure every word serves a clear purpose. Avoid redundant synonyms and meaningless embellishments.";
"描述维度参考" = "Voice Description Dimensions";
"建议组合以下维度描述声音，维度越丰富，生成效果越精准。" = "Combine the following dimensions to describe a voice. The more dimensions you include, the more precise the generated result will be.";
